# Keep the server image context small and secret-free. The Dockerfile only
# COPYs package.json, package-lock.json and apps/server/{package.json,
# tsconfig.json,src}; everything else is build tooling, other apps, or secrets.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/mobile
apps/faces
apps/eval/src
apps/eval/debug
apps/server/.env
apps/server/thethirdeye.db*
apps/server/scripts
docs
*.log
